{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">早前網上流傳一段影片，爆出疑似歌手呂方與網約車司機發生罵戰，當中一句對白「向後bye（向後掰）」更意外爆紅，成為近期的最新潮語。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">自事件曝光後，一直未有對外表態的呂方，於早前突然在社交平台小紅書發文更新近況。他幽默地留言寫道：「今晚放棄四輪，換兩輪兜兜風～騎車之前記得把車梯向後掰😉」，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">呂方騎着共享單車直豎拇指，心情似乎未受事件影響。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d6e1ff7d-6d5c-4da4-ba6e-a6edbaabd496.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026TrRQOpWqoM1783998629.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d6e1ff7d-6d5c-4da4-ba6e-a6edbaabd496.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"141340e2-0aa3-432f-a0cf-b18049455071.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026X6PxkkbJrA1783998623.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"141340e2-0aa3-432f-a0cf-b18049455071.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">私隱專員公署表示，接獲一宗市民就相關錄影片段作出的投訴，公署已向相關社交平台發出停止披露通知，要求平台停止披露有關錄影片段。</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T08:18:52.918185+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}